<title>USA: MedAmicus renews $1.2 mln credit pact.</title>
<headline>MedAmicus renews $1.2 mln credit pact.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedAmicus Inc, which develops and makes medical products for the gynecology, urology and cardiology markets, said Thursday it has renewed a $1.2 million line of credit with Norwest Business Credit for another year at a reduced rate.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company reported its 1997 second quarter loss narrowed to $0.02 a share from $0.11 in the year ago quarter. Sales rose to $1.8 million from $1.3 million in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
